# TrajectoryGeneration.srv — DRY single surface.  Core schema is embedded
# (TrajectoryGoal → TrajectoryResult), not mirrored by hand.  The two
# StateCollisions fields carry the plan's start/goal diagnostics on the
# top-level response too, so a failed plan remains introspectable without
# digging into the nested result.
TrajectoryGoal request    # start_pose + goalsets
---
TrajectoryResult response # success / message / trajectory / stats / collisions
StateCollisions start_state_collisions   # collision diagnostics (also on failure)
StateCollisions end_state_collisions     # collision diagnostics (also on failure)
